388:  * (MainScene.cpp:402), so there is no floor for a blob to land on - the
389:  * projection would hang in the void at terrain height, under islands it has
390:  * no relationship to. The original suppresses every shadow on this world
391:  * explicitly and separately: mounts, fenrir and weapons in `Draw_RenderObject`
392:  * (ZzzObject.cpp:761, 836, 971), characters and monsters in `ZzzCharacter.cpp`
393:  * (:8384, :8459), items in `RenderPartObjectEffect` (:9378, :10403) and the
394:  * boids in `GOBoid.cpp`. One set is the same rule stated once.
