429: /**
430:  * Bumped whenever something that `blobShadowsActive` depends on changes (the
431:  * shadows toggle, the lighting tier taking the sun off the blobs). Each
432:  * `ModelObject` re-applies its own slots' enabled state when it sees a new
433:  * value, instead of this walking every mesh in the scene - and, unlike that
434:  * walk, it composes with the per-object frustum gate.
435:  */
