 280: /**
 281:  * The caster alight: `if (o->CurrentAction == PLAYER_SKILL_HELL &&
 282:  * rand_fps_check(1))` spawns BITMAP_FIRE off ten random bones every tick
 283:  * (ZzzCharacter.cpp:5633-5639), so the wizard burns for the whole jump instead
 284:  * of only where he lands. Ten cards a tick is a particle system's price, not a
 285:  * sprite layer's; four reads the same at a quarter of the spawns.
