 313:  * terrain - but the ground here is a simulation rather than a texture, and a
 314:  * fireball that leaves a snowfield untouched is the one thing on screen that
 315:  * gives that away. Radius in tiles; it takes only x/z, so a hit at a target's
 316:  * chest still melts what is under them. Free to call anywhere: a map with no
