115:  * `IsRagefighterCommonWeapon` (MonkSystem.cpp:209): the low-tier
116:  * sword/axe/mace models a Rage Fighter carries on custom offsets.
117:  */
118: const RAGE_FIGHTER_COMMON = new Set([
119:   '0:0', // Kris
120:   '0:1', // Short Sword
121:   '1:0', // Small Axe
122:   '1:1', // Hand Axe
123:   '1:3', // Tomahawk
124:   '2:0', // Small Mace
125:   '2:1', // Morning Star
126:   '2:2', // Flail
127:   '2:3', // Great Hammer
128:   '2:4', // Crystal Morning Star
